Title: Scan panels/paths name the brand; the run carries the --reasoning-effort parameter
Why: The start, live-status and final-report panels were titled STRIX; the Output line and sandbox-image error printed hard-coded strix_runs/ and ~/.strix paths. Also: carries --reasoning-effort into the non-interactive run's scan_config (strix/jitera/reasoning.py).
Upstream-PR: none

